WEBVTT

00:05.160 --> 00:07.220
The Christmas party is coming up.

00:07.220 --> 00:12.720
Let's all sing a nice song 
for our mommies and daddies!

00:12.720 --> 00:15.740
It's a Christmas song called "Silent Night."

00:15.740 --> 00:17.490
I wonder what it sounds like!

00:17.490 --> 00:19.220
I can't wait to hear!

00:19.220 --> 00:22.240
I'll sing it once first to show you.

00:22.240 --> 00:24.170
Listen closely, all right?

00:27.370 --> 00:31.960
Silent night...

00:29.660 --> 00:30.520
Siren?

00:30.520 --> 00:31.960
Hush!

00:31.960 --> 00:35.710
Holy night...

00:35.710 --> 00:37.880
She made a funny sound!

00:40.130 --> 00:42.020
I'm sorry about that.

00:42.020 --> 00:44.660
I'll practice really hard 
before the party, okay?

00:45.440 --> 00:48.680
Anna-chan, I can sing that song!

00:48.680 --> 00:50.060
You can?

00:50.060 --> 00:52.810
Yeah, I sang it with my mama!

00:53.440 --> 00:56.990
Silent night...

00:56.990 --> 00:58.140
So good!

00:58.140 --> 00:59.610
Wow!

01:01.270 --> 01:05.590
Okay, then let's all practice together!

01:05.590 --> 01:07.070
Okay!

01:08.310 --> 01:09.410
A present?

01:10.090 --> 01:12.440
We've got Christmas coming up, right?

01:12.440 --> 01:15.380
Wonder if there's anything Miri wants.

01:15.380 --> 01:17.270
<i>Morio Kart 2nd Edition</i>.

01:17.270 --> 01:19.510
That's what <i>you</i> want!

01:19.510 --> 01:20.380
I pre-ordered it.

01:20.380 --> 01:22.720
Then why do you need two copies?!

01:22.720 --> 01:24.730
<b>Aozora
 Daycare</b>

01:26.020 --> 01:26.980
Huh?

01:32.120 --> 01:33.420
Isn't that...

01:34.170 --> 01:35.860
Miri's mother.

01:37.360 --> 01:40.910
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

01:40.910 --> 01:44.540
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

01:44.540 --> 01:46.790
<i>What should I do?</i>

01:46.790 --> 01:49.170
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

01:52.460 --> 01:55.460
<i>As usual, the whole city</i>

01:55.460 --> 01:59.130
<i>Is madly in love and excited</i>

01:59.130 --> 02:02.680
<i>Extras like me just go home</i>

02:02.680 --> 02:05.980
<i>But I'm not sulking at all</i>

02:05.980 --> 02:09.810
<i>"And then you appeared suddenly</i>

02:09.810 --> 02:13.360
<i>As though you were ripping 
through those days</i>

02:13.360 --> 02:16.940
<i>With your smile that leaves me numb</i>

02:16.940 --> 02:21.280
<i>You shattered my heart</i>

02:22.450 --> 02:26.040
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

02:26.040 --> 02:29.670
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

02:29.670 --> 02:31.830
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:31.830 --> 02:34.170
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

02:34.460 --> 02:36.550
<i>How the heck should I know?</i>

02:36.550 --> 02:40.380
<i>I don't know what's going on in your head</i>

02:40.380 --> 02:44.050
<i>But it's not fair that you're so friendly</i>

02:44.050 --> 02:48.770
<i>Once again, I'm being 
swallowed up by your rhythm</i>

02:50.940 --> 02:55.610
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

03:01.910 --> 03:06.790
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

03:09.710 --> 03:11.610
I'm Unasaka Misaki.

03:12.260 --> 03:14.820
We've met previously.

03:18.490 --> 03:20.090
What do you want?

03:20.530 --> 03:21.890
I've...

03:21.890 --> 03:23.390
I've come to take Miri.

03:24.510 --> 03:26.930
Take her? Hang on...

03:27.360 --> 03:29.650
That's a whole lotta nerve you've got here.

03:29.650 --> 03:30.510
But—

03:30.510 --> 03:36.070
You're the one who threw Miri out and 
said you didn't want to see her again!

03:36.070 --> 03:37.830
What the hell are you thinking?!

03:38.110 --> 03:40.370
I am her mother.

03:40.370 --> 03:43.290
I have the right to live with my daughter.

03:43.290 --> 03:45.220
It's a little damn late for that!

03:45.220 --> 03:45.940
You know we've—

03:45.940 --> 03:46.490
Hey.

03:49.780 --> 03:51.910
It's Mama!

03:51.910 --> 03:53.840
It's my mama!

03:53.840 --> 03:55.510
Mama!

03:55.720 --> 03:56.660
Miri, wait—

03:59.650 --> 04:02.510
Miri, I've missed you!

04:03.230 --> 04:05.060
It's Mama!

04:19.190 --> 04:21.830
I drew this one!

04:21.830 --> 04:24.070
That's very good.

04:24.300 --> 04:26.720
I drew this one of my friends!

04:26.720 --> 04:29.960
They're Kotori-chan and Hinata-chan.

04:26.730 --> 04:28.900
Why'd we let her come back with us?

04:28.900 --> 04:32.230
We can't exactly have a serious 
talk in front of a daycare.

04:30.610 --> 04:32.650
You must have a lot of friends.

04:32.230 --> 04:34.620
We shoulda told her to pound sand!

04:32.650 --> 04:33.670
Isn't that nice.

04:33.670 --> 04:34.620
Yep!

04:34.620 --> 04:36.210
In front of Miri, dude?

04:38.300 --> 04:40.630
Mama! Hurry! Come quick!

04:43.510 --> 04:45.570
This is my room!

04:46.020 --> 04:47.420
Goodness!

04:49.120 --> 04:50.310
Look, look!

04:51.520 --> 04:53.980
These are all yours?

04:53.980 --> 04:56.590
My papas bought them for me!

04:56.590 --> 04:57.880
I see.

04:58.690 --> 04:59.940
Hey, Miri.

04:59.940 --> 05:01.670
Do you have a lot of fun here?

05:01.670 --> 05:02.520
Yeah!

05:03.180 --> 05:07.390
Then... you'd rather be here than with me?

05:11.650 --> 05:13.460
I love my mama!

05:15.590 --> 05:17.620
I love my papas too!

05:20.130 --> 05:21.630
I'm sorry.

05:21.960 --> 05:24.110
I don't know what came over me.

05:24.110 --> 05:26.560
Why I sent you away...

05:27.120 --> 05:28.970
Mama! Hamburg steak!

05:29.920 --> 05:32.960
I wanna eat your Hamburg steak!

05:35.210 --> 05:37.290
What the hell's going on?

05:37.290 --> 05:40.190
I'm having Mama's Hamburg steak today!

05:40.610 --> 05:43.170
She said she wanted Hamburg steak,

05:43.170 --> 05:45.330
so we went shopping together.

05:45.330 --> 05:48.120
Eat with us, Papas!

05:48.120 --> 05:51.140
Hey, hey! Mama! Make it quick!

05:51.140 --> 05:54.120
I'm sorry. I'll need to use your kitchen.

05:56.100 --> 05:58.030
It's making Miri happy.

05:58.030 --> 06:00.680
You just don't get it, man...

06:00.680 --> 06:04.900
There's nothing worse than having someone 
else mess around in your kitchen!

06:04.900 --> 06:05.540
<i>That's</i> the issue?

06:15.890 --> 06:17.980
<b>Instant Hamburg Steak

Microwave OK!

Refrigeration Needed</b>

06:23.090 --> 06:25.100
It's so tasty, Mama!

06:25.100 --> 06:27.360
I'm glad you like it.

06:27.360 --> 06:28.570
Stupid...

06:28.570 --> 06:32.180
My Hamburg steak uses minced A5 Kuroge Wagyu,

06:32.180 --> 06:34.850
organically-grown Awajishima onions,

06:34.850 --> 06:36.860
Nagoya Cochin-brand eggs...

06:35.460 --> 06:37.190
Hey, yeah, this <i>is</i> good.

06:40.630 --> 06:43.560
You're singing at a Christmas party?

06:43.560 --> 06:46.660
Yeah, it's a song called "Silent Night"!

06:46.660 --> 06:48.860
We used to sing that together, didn't we?

06:48.860 --> 06:51.150
Make sure you practice a lot.

06:51.150 --> 06:52.060
Sure!

06:52.730 --> 06:54.640
Mama, sing with me!

06:58.590 --> 07:00.960
I charge a lot for my songs.

07:00.960 --> 07:03.850
I'm afraid your papas would have to pay...

07:03.850 --> 07:06.420
I can't give them away for free.

07:06.730 --> 07:08.550
Papa! Pay up!

07:08.550 --> 07:09.610
Hell no!

07:16.540 --> 07:18.740
Okay, let's get down to brass tacks.

07:19.860 --> 07:21.640
Why now?

07:25.700 --> 07:27.310
No smoking here.

07:29.880 --> 07:32.180
I got fired.

07:32.180 --> 07:34.010
My man left me.

07:34.800 --> 07:37.560
The cancer spread to here,

07:37.560 --> 07:39.400
and I can't sing anymore.

07:40.680 --> 07:41.560
You gonna die?

07:41.560 --> 07:42.540
Hey!

07:42.540 --> 07:44.640
God's so cruel.

07:45.250 --> 07:47.570
After everything I've been through already,

07:47.570 --> 07:50.020
he throws this on the pile.

07:50.020 --> 07:52.340
I don't give a damn about your sob story.

07:52.340 --> 07:53.940
It's got nothing to do with Miri.

07:55.570 --> 08:00.210
I don't know how much longer I have to live.

08:01.750 --> 08:06.130
So I hoped you'd have pity 
and forgive my selfishness.

08:06.780 --> 08:10.000
I want a fresh start with my daughter.

08:10.420 --> 08:15.320
Hitting rock bottom has made me realize 
what's most important in life.

08:15.800 --> 08:19.430
I'm going to go back to my parents 
to make an honest go at life.

08:20.180 --> 08:23.500
All I really need is my child.

08:24.110 --> 08:25.210
Please...

08:25.520 --> 08:26.810
Please!

08:29.010 --> 08:30.190
Stop it.

08:30.790 --> 08:34.450
Miri's excited about her 
daycare's Christmas party.

08:34.450 --> 08:36.940
I don't think it'd be right 
to move her around now.

08:37.570 --> 08:41.230
I'll make sure she can stay 
at that daycare for a while.

08:41.230 --> 08:42.950
I'll rent an apartment nearby.

08:42.950 --> 08:46.360
I'll do whatever it takes 
to give her a happy life.

08:49.000 --> 08:50.920
You've really changed.

08:51.710 --> 08:53.530
To make up for everything I put her through,

08:53.530 --> 08:57.180
I want to start living my life just for her.

08:58.510 --> 09:00.970
It's still all about you, huh?

09:00.970 --> 09:03.060
What Miri wants matters too.

09:04.070 --> 09:05.410
I know that.

09:10.780 --> 09:14.960
I thank you for all you've 
done to watch over her.

09:16.740 --> 09:21.620
But I also know you're 
involved in dangerous work.

09:24.600 --> 09:30.380
As her mother, I can't leave 
her in your care any longer.

09:30.900 --> 09:34.540
If you consider yourselves 
her parents as well,

09:34.540 --> 09:36.380
you must agree.

09:46.340 --> 09:48.680
I'll take my leave for now.

09:56.190 --> 09:58.200
<b>Yadorigi
Coffee • Light Meals</b>

09:58.460 --> 10:00.700
Miri's mother showed up?

10:00.700 --> 10:03.910
Yeah. Came in like a freight train.

10:03.910 --> 10:06.580
Miri was asleep when we sent her on her way,

10:06.580 --> 10:08.490
which sent her into maximum sulk mode.

10:09.430 --> 10:14.180
How'd her mom find out where 
we were and what we do?

10:14.870 --> 10:16.310
I told her.

10:18.020 --> 10:20.180
H-How come, Kyu-chan?

10:20.180 --> 10:22.140
You mean you're the one who called her?

10:25.190 --> 10:26.150
That...

10:26.490 --> 10:28.560
That's not the picture we took.

10:29.020 --> 10:31.740
You're familiar with Ogino Ryo, correct?

10:33.500 --> 10:35.200
Why's he after Miri?

10:35.520 --> 10:37.250
I'm giving you a warning.

10:38.000 --> 10:42.840
Her presence in your lives 
has made your work sloppy.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.660
The organization won't tolerate it.

10:46.390 --> 10:48.780
That's why I contacted her mother.

10:49.340 --> 10:52.850
Get rid of her soon, or they'll 
give you more than a warning.

10:53.100 --> 10:55.040
No way. You want us to...

10:55.780 --> 11:00.060
Unless you're willing to turn 
on the organization. Are you?

11:00.690 --> 11:01.990
I...

11:05.540 --> 11:07.950
He betrayed the organization.

11:07.950 --> 11:11.080
You'd better not betray my expectations.

11:19.480 --> 11:24.180
For you, for the mother, and for Miri,

11:24.180 --> 11:26.360
this is the best outcome
one could hope for.

11:27.050 --> 11:31.030
But still... you can't just ask us to—

11:30.420 --> 11:31.750
Have you forgotten?

11:32.390 --> 11:35.870
You're the ones who killed her father.

11:37.530 --> 11:42.310
Yet you want to put on smiling 
faces and play the happy family?

11:42.750 --> 11:46.050
You don't think she'll see 
through that eventually?

11:48.030 --> 11:50.740
Put an end to the lies.

11:52.420 --> 11:54.370
All this was only ever a dream.

12:02.980 --> 12:05.280
Okay! Rise and shine, Miri!

12:05.280 --> 12:08.100
There's no daycare today!

12:08.100 --> 12:10.740
We're hitting the town! 
Let's get you dressed!

12:11.300 --> 12:12.620
Hitting the town?!

12:15.760 --> 12:17.750
Wake up! Wake up!

12:16.310 --> 12:17.750
Papa Rei!

12:18.050 --> 12:20.510
We're hitting the town!

12:22.070 --> 12:24.440
Hey, Papa! Where are we going?

12:24.440 --> 12:26.090
No tell!

12:26.090 --> 12:27.840
Mean!

12:28.460 --> 12:29.910
Hey!

12:29.020 --> 12:30.700
Where'd this come from?

12:29.910 --> 12:32.020
Where?

12:30.700 --> 12:32.410
A little family day.

12:32.020 --> 12:33.610
Where are we going?

12:33.610 --> 12:38.130
Where are we going?!

12:34.120 --> 12:37.250
So we don't have any regrets.

12:39.890 --> 12:43.110
Silent night...

12:45.310 --> 12:46.670
Ta-dah!

12:46.670 --> 12:48.290
Our destination today...

12:48.290 --> 12:49.910
is here!

12:50.590 --> 12:52.840
Hey! Hey! Tell me what it is!

12:53.150 --> 12:58.190
It's full of the kinds of places kids love!

12:58.190 --> 13:01.250
See? It's got this one, and this one!

13:01.250 --> 13:03.560
It sounds like so much fun!

13:04.070 --> 13:06.190
I bet you can't wait, Papa Rei!

13:06.590 --> 13:08.550
Yeah, guess not.

13:08.930 --> 13:09.770
Heck yeah!

13:09.770 --> 13:12.630
Let's rock this place!

13:12.630 --> 13:13.760
Yeah!

13:12.630 --> 13:13.760
Yeah...

13:22.520 --> 13:24.460
Wow, looking good!

13:27.270 --> 13:29.280
Yeah!

13:29.490 --> 13:30.970
Say cheese!

13:30.970 --> 13:31.780
Okay!

13:32.410 --> 13:33.620
Miri!

13:34.140 --> 13:35.070
Take that!

13:38.190 --> 13:39.290
Hey!

13:40.090 --> 13:41.250
You okay?

13:41.540 --> 13:43.650
I-If anything happens to our girl...

13:43.650 --> 13:45.440
She's perfectly safe, sir.

13:45.440 --> 13:47.620
B-But what if she slips?!

13:47.620 --> 13:49.400
That's why she has a safety line.

13:49.400 --> 13:51.270
B-But what if it snaps?!

13:51.270 --> 13:52.720
Calm down, dude.

13:59.310 --> 14:01.600
Papa Rei looks so cool!

14:04.900 --> 14:07.120
Can't do it! Too scared!

14:07.120 --> 14:09.750
Papa Kazuki looks so bad!

14:17.750 --> 14:19.620
<b>See you at 6 at the place we agreed on.</b>

14:19.620 --> 14:21.500
<b>Message sent.</b>

14:20.160 --> 14:22.430
I wanna play more!

14:23.130 --> 14:24.520
Me too.

14:24.520 --> 14:25.910
Bet you're hungry, huh?

14:25.910 --> 14:27.420
Let's get something to eat!

14:27.420 --> 14:28.380
Okay!

14:31.520 --> 14:34.020
Papa, I want that!

14:34.020 --> 14:35.130
Hey, that looks good.

14:35.360 --> 14:36.790
You buy.

14:36.790 --> 14:38.600
I'll save us a seat.

14:39.020 --> 14:40.050
Which one do you want?

14:40.050 --> 14:43.060
I love strawberries, and bananas too...

14:48.800 --> 14:50.520
Wow, that's a big one!

14:50.520 --> 14:51.930
I got um, um...

14:51.930 --> 14:53.080
An everything!

14:53.080 --> 14:55.360
That looks better than I thought.

14:55.360 --> 14:57.450
I kinda want one now too!

14:58.780 --> 15:01.090
Papa Kazuki, say ah!

15:01.390 --> 15:02.690
You mean it?

15:03.170 --> 15:05.080
What a good kid!

15:05.420 --> 15:06.770
Ah!

15:07.190 --> 15:10.280
Here! Papa Rei, you too!

15:10.280 --> 15:11.510
No, I—

15:18.150 --> 15:19.740
It's good.

15:19.740 --> 15:22.170
We shared it three ways!

15:22.170 --> 15:24.360
We've been through this before, right?

15:24.360 --> 15:27.240
It tastes better when we all eat together!

15:32.730 --> 15:33.660
Hey, Miri.

15:33.660 --> 15:34.750
Can I have another bite?

15:35.270 --> 15:36.620
No more!

15:36.620 --> 15:39.310
But there's a lot left, right?

15:39.310 --> 15:41.400
Can't I have a little?

15:43.760 --> 15:45.430
This is my part!

15:45.430 --> 15:47.010
Mean. Meanie Miri.

15:47.280 --> 15:48.310
Weenie Papa!

15:48.560 --> 15:49.860
Not weenie!

15:49.860 --> 15:51.100
He said "meanie."

15:51.100 --> 15:53.270
Weenie, Weenie, Weenie Papa!

15:57.420 --> 15:59.280
That was so good!

15:59.280 --> 16:01.170
But now your face is all sticky.

16:01.170 --> 16:03.000
Come over here.

16:06.890 --> 16:09.920
There! All clean.

16:09.920 --> 16:11.690
Thanks, Papa!

16:12.740 --> 16:14.220
Here you go!

16:14.220 --> 16:15.540
Thank you!

16:16.230 --> 16:18.590
I wish Mama could've eaten with us!

16:21.310 --> 16:23.820
Mama. I wanna go over there!

16:23.820 --> 16:25.570
I want three!{on-screen}

16:25.570 --> 16:26.750
Sure, okay. Let's go.

16:26.580 --> 16:28.490
That's right, Miri.

16:26.750 --> 16:27.470
Okay!

16:28.490 --> 16:31.090
I bet that would've been great.

16:31.090 --> 16:33.830
It tastes better when we 
all eat together, right?

16:33.830 --> 16:35.320
You're totally right.

16:40.030 --> 16:42.180
What are you doing, Papa?

16:42.840 --> 16:45.520
Thanks for teaching me that.

16:45.520 --> 16:47.790
Hey, that tickles!

16:51.620 --> 16:52.720
Papa?

16:53.140 --> 16:54.990
Oh, it's nothing!

16:54.990 --> 16:57.890
Well, what do you wanna do next?

16:57.890 --> 17:00.740
I wanna play video games!

17:02.640 --> 17:03.900
Hey, Rei.

17:03.900 --> 17:04.730
Yeah?

17:05.440 --> 17:09.750
You think we took her mother's happiness?

17:10.640 --> 17:11.750
I'm not sure.

17:12.740 --> 17:17.340
If we told Miri the truth, 
do you think she'd forgive us?

17:18.640 --> 17:21.090
I don't think she'd understand right now.

17:21.670 --> 17:22.540
Yeah.

17:25.380 --> 17:27.520
Let's just have fun for today.

17:28.640 --> 17:31.000
Come on. Miri's waiting.

17:38.950 --> 17:41.320
Papa Rei's so good!

17:43.370 --> 17:46.200
You sure? I can have all these?!

17:46.200 --> 17:48.960
You got it! Buy all you want!

17:48.960 --> 17:50.550
I'm lousy at games,

17:50.550 --> 17:53.380
but at spending money? I'm a master!

17:53.380 --> 17:54.710
Yeah!

17:54.710 --> 17:57.470
Thank you, Papa Kazuki!

17:58.390 --> 18:01.220
I wanna wear this to the Christmas party!

18:01.220 --> 18:02.880
Looks good on you.

18:02.880 --> 18:04.770
Like a real princess!

18:05.990 --> 18:08.480
Make sure you come watch, Papas!

18:16.100 --> 18:18.980
Now for the day's climax!

18:19.300 --> 18:21.660
It's so big!

18:21.660 --> 18:24.600
I've never been on a Ferris wheel before!

18:25.840 --> 18:28.030
Are Ferris wheels scary?

18:28.030 --> 18:29.110
No.

18:29.950 --> 18:32.100
They let you see really far, though!

18:40.350 --> 18:42.650
So pretty!

18:44.080 --> 18:45.360
It's not scary?

18:45.360 --> 18:46.350
No!

18:54.670 --> 18:56.330
Last winter,

18:56.330 --> 18:58.470
you brought a cat home, remember?

18:59.650 --> 19:00.790
You got mad.

19:01.140 --> 19:03.750
Remember what I said to you?

19:04.920 --> 19:06.050
No.

19:06.980 --> 19:09.300
Sometimes it's kinder not to get involved.

19:14.720 --> 19:18.480
If you're not really prepared, 
getting involved can make things worse.

19:19.120 --> 19:21.560
If you can't watch over them to the end...

19:22.140 --> 19:24.760
"Don't get involved if you 
can't see it through..."

19:26.090 --> 19:27.340
To say that now...

19:27.770 --> 19:31.140
To say that after we're 
all attached... it's cruel.

19:32.060 --> 19:33.710
It might not be too late.

19:34.380 --> 19:36.570
Too late? For what?

19:37.860 --> 19:39.330
Normal happiness.

19:42.260 --> 19:45.570
I want her to eat Hamburg 
steak and smile forever.

19:46.130 --> 19:52.710
Fight with friends, practice for
 school races, sing songs...

19:54.500 --> 19:55.930
I know, but...

19:56.590 --> 20:01.480
There's only one thing we can do now.

20:06.390 --> 20:09.140
We're at the top!

20:09.140 --> 20:10.500
Look! Look!

20:10.500 --> 20:12.360
Papa, we're at the tippy-top!

20:12.770 --> 20:14.490
Hey, really?

20:14.490 --> 20:16.480
That's the best part!

20:16.480 --> 20:18.120
Get yourself an eyeful!

20:20.030 --> 20:21.120
I'll come, too.

20:27.130 --> 20:29.110
It's so pretty!

20:30.260 --> 20:31.380
Yeah.

20:32.180 --> 20:34.710
Yeah, it's really pretty.

20:40.410 --> 20:42.880
Oh, we're going down now.

20:44.320 --> 20:47.400
We got far more than our share.

20:48.000 --> 20:52.400
Thanks to you, Miri, I've seen 
things I'd never seen before.

20:54.070 --> 20:57.360
Time to wake up from the dream.

21:12.400 --> 21:13.470
Mama?

21:14.000 --> 21:18.190
Here's the last surprise 
present from your papas.

21:18.460 --> 21:22.080
A sleepover for just you and Mama!

21:23.890 --> 21:26.020
Thank you, Papa!

21:39.580 --> 21:40.550
Miri!

21:50.420 --> 21:52.200
Don't want you catching cold.

21:52.200 --> 21:53.150
Okay!

22:00.620 --> 22:04.390
See you tomorrow, Papa!

22:18.240 --> 22:21.000
Guess we weren't able to change.

22:21.760 --> 22:22.600
Yeah.

22:30.530 --> 22:35.580
<i>The scenery never changes and 
every day is full of surprises</i>

22:35.580 --> 22:40.040
<i>But those are the best parts</i>

22:40.040 --> 22:44.800
<i>Wrapped around your finger 
and going in circles</i>

22:45.050 --> 22:49.680
<i>These days are dizzying yet endearing</i>

22:49.890 --> 22:54.220
<i>On your restless nights, 
I softly whisper a lullaby</i>

22:54.220 --> 22:58.980
<i>And stroke your hair to the 
rhythm of your breathing</i>

22:59.440 --> 23:03.570
<i>I just want these days to 
continue as long as possible</i>

23:03.570 --> 23:08.570
<i>Even if it's just a day</i>

23:09.360 --> 23:14.280
<i>I chased after you as you ran barefoot</i>

23:14.280 --> 23:18.500
<i>Maybe one day, you'll surpass me, ah</i>

23:18.500 --> 23:23.170
<i>I wonder what tomorrow's going to be like</i>

23:23.170 --> 23:28.090
<i>Why don't we walk together?</i>

23:28.090 --> 23:32.850
<i>This will always be our place to come home to</i>

23:33.350 --> 23:37.640
<i>And it'll shine down on our sadness</i>

23:37.640 --> 23:42.310
<i>That's all right, yeah, that's okay</i>

23:42.310 --> 23:47.230
<i>Let's try to share our love together</i>

23:47.230 --> 23:50.650
<i>Let the light always shine upon hope</i>

23:50.650 --> 23:57.160
<i>When the future is unpredictable</i>
